---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="TakeoutFix | Refund Policy" description="Read the Refund Policy for TakeoutFix. Learn about our verified software issue refund guarantee and request conditions.">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 py-16 mt-20">
    <div class="text-center mb-16">
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold tracking-tighter mb-4">Refund Policy</h1>
      <p class="text-xl text-white/60">Last updated: June 12, 2026</p>
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-12 text-white/80 leading-relaxed">
      
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4">1. Our Commitment</h2>
        <p>
          We want you to have a great experience with Takeout Fix. If you experience a genuine technical issue that prevents the software from functioning as described, we'll work with you to resolve it. If we're unable to resolve the issue, you may be eligible for a refund.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4">2. Refund Eligibility</h2>
        <p>
          You may request a refund within <strong class="text-white">7 days</strong> of your purchase if:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 mt-3 text-zinc-350">
          <li>Takeout Fix is unable to perform its advertised functionality due to a verified software issue.</li>
          <li>Our support team is unable to provide a working solution within a reasonable time.</li>
          <li>The purchase was made directly through Takeout Fix.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4">3. Non-Refundable Situations</h2>
        <p>
          Refunds are generally not provided for:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 mt-3 text-zinc-350">
          <li>Changing your mind after purchase.</li>
          <li>Purchasing the wrong plan.</li>
          <li>Recoveries that completed successfully.</li>
          <li>Unsupported or corrupted Google Takeout exports.</li>
          <li>Issues caused by third-party software or modifications outside Takeout Fix.</li>
          <li>Requests submitted more than 7 days after purchase.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4">4. How to Request a Refund</h2>
        <ol class="list-decimal pl-6 space-y-2 mt-3 text-zinc-350">
          <li>Open a support ticket through the Takeout Fix Support Center.</li>
          <li>Describe the issue and attach your processing log if available.</li>
          <li>Our team will investigate the issue and respond as quickly as possible.</li>
        </ol>
        <p class="mt-4">
          Most refund requests are reviewed within <strong class="text-white">2–5 business days</strong>.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4">5. Our Promise</h2>
        <p>
          Our goal is to solve your problem—not simply close your ticket. We'll make every reasonable effort to help you recover your metadata before considering a refund.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4">6. Contact</h2>
        <p>
          All refund requests must be submitted through the in-app <a href="/support" class="text-indigo-400 hover:text-indigo-300 font-bold">Support Center</a>.
        </p>
      </section>

    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
